        "The value of family: Remaining steadfast despite pressure from close relatives to abandon faith.",
        "Economic responsibility: Using one's wealth to empower the Ummah and sustain the needy.",
        "Courage in the face of odds: Entering enemy ranks alone during Yarmouk to break their morale.",
        "Integrity in politics: Withdrawing from conflict when reminded of a hadith of the Prophet ﷺ.",
